1
00:00:50,159 --> 00:00:52,280
So, Mr. Liang

2
00:00:52,920 --> 00:00:54,799
why did you fight so hard to save me today

3
00:00:55,280 --> 00:00:56,960
when it had nothing to do with you?

4
00:01:01,799 --> 00:01:04,239
The truth is, I've always been alone

5
00:01:05,879 --> 00:01:06,920
all this time

6
00:01:08,159 --> 00:01:08,959
always feeling

7
00:01:09,719 --> 00:01:11,680
like there was no place I could return to

8
00:01:13,120 --> 00:01:15,319
But then I met you and Uncle Xiang

9
00:01:17,040 --> 00:01:17,799
and I feel

10
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:23,879
how do I put it

11
00:01:25,840 --> 00:01:26,840
it's just

12
00:01:30,760 --> 00:01:32,319
no matter what you think of me

13
00:01:33,920 --> 00:01:36,560
I feel I've come to see you both

14
00:01:38,920 --> 00:01:40,159
as people who matter so much to me

15
00:01:47,359 --> 00:01:48,760
The flower shop is your home

16
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:57,480
We are your home

17
00:02:03,400 --> 00:02:04,120
Thank you

18
00:02:49,080 --> 00:02:51,560
Even if you're a grown man living alone,

19
00:02:52,599 --> 00:02:54,840
you should still keep the place clean

20
00:03:04,280 --> 00:03:05,319
I'll go wipe it down

21
00:03:06,039 --> 00:03:06,840
Okay

22
00:03:30,960 --> 00:03:33,199
Damn it!

23
00:03:33,680 --> 00:03:34,879
Doing renovations?

24
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:41,280
Put on an extra layer.

25
00:03:41,319 --> 00:03:42,560
It's pouring outside.

26
00:03:42,560 --> 00:03:43,520
Don't catch a cold.

27
00:05:33,199 --> 00:05:34,079
Does it hurt?

28
00:05:36,160 --> 00:05:38,519
It hurts so bad, boss!

29
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:50,079
Check the security footage.

30
00:05:50,680 --> 00:05:53,279
It's Liang Zhiqiang.

31
00:05:54,000 --> 00:05:54,879
He's alone.

32
00:06:08,000 --> 00:06:08,920
How many guys do we have?

33
00:06:11,399 --> 00:06:12,319
Twenty.

34
00:06:14,399 --> 00:06:15,879
Maybe thirty, even.

35
00:06:23,560 --> 00:06:27,800
Looks like he wants to rally the troops.

36
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:31,000
Rally the troops?

37
00:06:31,800 --> 00:06:32,639
What year do you think this is?

38
00:06:33,279 --> 00:06:34,160
Think we're the triads?

39
00:06:38,680 --> 00:06:40,639
Liang Zhiqiang.

40
00:06:53,040 --> 00:06:56,040
These scars are all from the old days.

41
00:07:01,199 --> 00:07:04,360
In this life, it's hard to avoid.

42
00:07:07,079 --> 00:07:08,560
How'd you get this one?

43
00:07:10,160 --> 00:07:12,600
When I was a teenager, just starting out.

44
00:07:12,759 --> 00:07:14,000
Collecting protection money.

45
00:07:14,800 --> 00:07:16,399
That vendor saw I was just a kid.

46
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:18,399
So he slashed me with a knife.

47
00:07:18,879 --> 00:07:19,839
Back then,

48
00:07:19,879 --> 00:07:22,000
I really thought I was invincible.

49
00:07:22,800 --> 00:07:23,920
I just charged right in.

50
00:07:24,160 --> 00:07:25,160
And took a slash for nothing.

51
00:07:31,240 --> 00:07:32,040
And this one?

52
00:07:33,120 --> 00:07:34,000
This one.

53
00:07:34,519 --> 00:07:36,160
Back then, Ah Hong and I,

54
00:07:36,800 --> 00:07:38,360
were getting payback for Brother Long.

55
00:07:38,959 --> 00:07:40,040
We got ambushed.

56
00:07:40,560 --> 00:07:41,759
Got slashed four times.

57
00:07:43,120 --> 00:07:44,319
This one was the deepest.

58
00:07:46,639 --> 00:07:47,720
That time,

59
00:07:48,560 --> 00:07:50,160
we both got badly hurt.

60
00:07:50,800 --> 00:07:52,680
But it instantly earned us respect.

61
00:07:56,040 --> 00:07:56,839
And this?

62
00:07:57,560 --> 00:07:58,680
This one's a birthmark.

63
00:08:05,000 --> 00:08:05,800
And...

64
00:08:06,480 --> 00:08:07,360
this one?

65
00:08:10,399 --> 00:08:11,600
This one.

66
00:08:14,079 --> 00:08:15,720
This one nearly killed me.

67
00:08:17,199 --> 00:08:19,399
That time, with Ah Hong,

68
00:08:19,720 --> 00:08:21,560
we joined a gang showdown for Brother Long.

69
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:23,279
Ah Hong lost his mind for some reason,

70
00:08:23,279 --> 00:08:24,240
tried to kill Brother Long.

71
00:08:25,480 --> 00:08:26,560
One was my benefactor,

72
00:08:27,040 --> 00:08:28,240
the other was my brother.

73
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:29,680
It was total chaos.

74
00:08:30,800 --> 00:08:32,000
I got slashed,

75
00:08:32,919 --> 00:08:34,320
but my life was also saved.

76
00:08:35,240 --> 00:08:36,320
Did 20 years behind bars.

77
00:08:41,279 --> 00:08:44,000
I used to think these scars

78
00:08:44,039 --> 00:08:45,200
were all badges of honor.

79
00:08:46,399 --> 00:08:49,480
Now I regret every single one.

80
00:08:50,279 --> 00:08:53,720
Each one marks a debt I owe someone.

81
00:08:59,240 --> 00:09:00,399
It's all in the past now.

82
00:09:12,919 --> 00:09:13,600
Thank you

83
00:09:13,600 --> 00:09:15,759
for listening to me go on like this

84
00:09:21,960 --> 00:09:23,759
You should tell me more from now on

85
00:09:45,320 --> 00:09:47,159
Hello, I'm here to see Xie Guanhong.

86
00:09:47,279 --> 00:09:49,039
Do you have an appointment?

87
00:09:49,720 --> 00:09:51,879
Just tell him it's Liang Zhiqiang.

88
00:10:58,600 --> 00:10:59,919
That was a little off-key

89
00:11:00,120 --> 00:11:00,919
Let's try it again

90
00:11:00,960 --> 00:11:02,159
Okay

91
00:11:04,600 --> 00:11:05,440
Elephant

92
00:11:06,279 --> 00:11:07,799
Apologize to Brother Qiang

93
00:11:08,159 --> 00:11:08,720
Brother Qiang

94
00:11:08,960 --> 00:11:10,159
I failed to recognize your greatness

95
00:11:10,159 --> 00:11:10,879
I'm sorry

96
00:11:11,600 --> 00:11:12,559
Louder

97
00:11:14,200 --> 00:11:15,720
Brother Qiang, I failed to recognize your greatness

98
00:11:15,960 --> 00:11:16,559
It's all in the past now

99
00:11:16,559 --> 00:11:17,360
Let's not bring it up again

100
00:11:17,399 --> 00:11:17,960
Thank you, Brother Qiang

101
00:11:18,000 --> 00:11:18,519
Thank you, Brother Qiang

102
00:11:18,519 --> 00:11:19,399
for being the bigger person

103
00:11:19,440 --> 00:11:20,320
Thank you, Brother Qiang

104
00:11:37,799 --> 00:11:40,919
Uncle Xiang's flower shop has been open for years

105
00:11:42,159 --> 00:11:43,200
You let them go

106
00:11:43,840 --> 00:11:45,159
and they kidnapped his daughter

107
00:11:46,279 --> 00:11:48,120
That's going a bit too far, don't you think?

108
00:11:50,840 --> 00:11:52,799
I honestly had no idea about this

109
00:11:53,600 --> 00:11:55,039
Being the Dragon Head keeps me too busy

110
00:11:55,960 --> 00:11:57,240
I'm starting to understand more and more

111
00:11:57,240 --> 00:11:58,399
what it's like to be a boss

112
00:12:01,879 --> 00:12:03,399
Suddenly I think Cannon had a point

113
00:12:04,000 --> 00:12:05,200
You're level-headed

114
00:12:05,720 --> 00:12:07,039
and you've done a lot for the gang

115
00:12:10,480 --> 00:12:12,519
You'd make a better Dragon Head than me
